      "description": "Noteworthy Projects\n\t• Custom Product API\n\t\t○ Source of data for GoDataFeed and Google merchant along with other teams in the business\n\t\t○ Used a Stored Procedure to populate a custom table and then built an api to query that table\n\t\t○ Created it this way for performance reasons and limitations of Optimizely\n\t• Replaced BODs with fetchware\n\t\t○ More reliable and preformant\n\t• Built integration with Bill Trust to pull in invoices\n\t• Eye4Fraud Integration\n\t\t○ Saved the company money from fraudulent orders\n\t\t○ Worked with the business to get the requirements and set expectations\n\t• Remade the PIM to Website Integration\n\t\t○ This was being done through XML files but was slow and difficult to do smaller delta updates\n\t\t○ Used Pentaho to get the data out of our PIM (Agility)\n\t\t○ Then created the processors on the website side to consume the data\n\t\t○ This allowed for full and delta versions of the jobs\n\t• Separated out our EU sites into its own environment\n\t\t○ This helped with performance for customers in the EU so they were not connecting to a site hosted in the US\n\t• Used Kiuwan to fix security vulnerabilities on the sites\n\t\t○ Started with a few hundred vulnerabilities and have since gotten that down to zero\n\t\t○ Now PR's are scanned automatically to avoid new vulnerabilities from being introduced to the solution\n\t• Documented all processors and how they function\n\t\t○ This allows PO's and other business users to create and modify jobs without the help of a developer",
